    <string name="analytics_row">Share usage analytics</string>
    <string name="analytics_note">Off by default. Shares app usage information (screens opened, app version, device type) to help improve features. Eloquence never includes the text it reads aloud, dictionary entries, or synthesized audio in these reports.</string>
    <string name="perf_row">Share performance data</string>
    <string name="perf_note">Off by default. Enables measurement of app startup and response speed to help find slowdowns. Contains no speech content and does not include what the app reads aloud. Speech-engine timing is reported only together with crash reports.</string>
    <string name="crash_note">Crash reports are sent automatically to fix failures, including crashes in the speech engine. They contain device and app information and timing, never the text being read aloud. Crash reporting cannot be turned off.</string>
